# Flutter

Stack: Flutter/Dart in `mobile/company_chat`. Android is the current priority. Do not do iOS work unless explicitly requested.

Preserve secure login and session persistence. Do not clear refresh tokens on transient network/5xx errors. Avoid repeated splash/session restoration and false logout.

Optimize conversation lists, avatar loading, and message rendering without rewriting the app. Reuse existing Riverpod state and Dio/WebSocket networking.

Preserve foreground WebRTC audio calling and up-to-50-file uploads. Mobile supports individual attachment downloads; there is NO ZIP Download All.

Never embed AWS credentials or TURN_SECRET. Use existing Android release signing assets; never generate a replacement keystore without authorization.

Run `flutter analyze` and relevant tests. Build APK/AAB only when requested or required for a release.
